            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

          <div class="notes-card card" id="notes-card">
            <h4>Notes</h4>
            <p class="theory-note" id="theory-note">
              <strong>Plane wave.</strong>
              Normal-incidence cylinder scattering uses the Bohren-Huffman
              infinite-cylinder series. Efficiencies are normalized by the
              geometrical width 2a and converted to cross-section per unit length.
